*cupsIPPReason com.epson.CHKROLL_002-error/error message: "text:A%20roll%20paper%20is%20loaded%2C%20but%20the%20paper%20source%20selected%20in%20the%20printer%20driver%20is%20not%20appropriate%2E%20The%20print%20cannot%20be%20continued%2E%20Please%20
